lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">调研显示超半数企业后悔因AI裁员 福特IBM等多家巨头重新扩招人类员工</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 扩散语言模型，生成吞吐量提升 2.42 倍</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic旗下Claude系列大模型正式登陆Microsoft Foundry平台</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银集团通过愿景基金二号向OpenAI追加100亿美元投资</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银集团于7月1日正式宣布，已通过旗下愿景基金二号完成对OpenAI的100亿美元追加投资。此次注资旨在支持OpenAI在AI模型研发、商业化进程以及基础设施建设方面的持续投入。软银方面表示，该举措体现了其对OpenAI长期技术路线的高度认可，并进一步巩固了其在人工智能领域的战略布局。此外，软银已明确后续资本计划，预计将于今年10月1日完成第二笔金额同样为100亿美元的追加投资。这一系列连续的大额资金注入，将显著增强OpenAI的研发能力，并向全球市场释放出软银深耕AI生态、押注行业未来的明确信号，进一步加剧了全球人工智能行业的资本竞争态势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布AI生图模型Nano Banana 2 Lite，支持4秒出图并全面取代旧版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f70dcd19505d16e86ac5321d58e60cb8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布自研AI图像与视频生成模型Nano Banana 2 Lite，该模型主打高频批量内容生产，核心优势在于超低延迟，仅需4秒即可生成一张高质量图像。在计费方面，1K分辨率图像生成消耗1120个token，单张成本为0.034美元。目前，Nano Banana 2 Lite已全面登陆谷歌AI Studio、Gemini API及Gemini企业级智能体平台，并正式取代初代模型。此外，谷歌扩大了Gemini Omni Flash的开放范围，视频生成收费标准为每秒0.10美元。同步推出的演示应用Omni Product Studio支持将静态图像一键转化为电影级电商视频，旨在为开发者提供端到端的多媒体创作体验。此次更新显著提升了运行速度并降低了使用成本，旨在满足专业工作流程中对快速迭代与大批量产出的需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">调研显示超半数企业后悔因AI裁员 福特IBM等多家巨头重新扩招人类员工</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/954449aee41a5de3da95d05a59afa62d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">调研显示超半数企业后悔因AI裁员 福特IBM等多家巨头重新扩招人类员工AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 1, 202625随着人工智能技术的大规模落地，部分企业激进裁员引发的负面效应正集中显现，行业正迎来从“完全取代人类”向“人机协作”的理性回归。调研机构Orgvue发布的最新报告显示，在因部署人工智能而裁员的39%企业领导者中，高达55%的受访者承认裁员是一项错误决定。Intuition Labs的研究同样指出，仅聚焦技术替代而忽视员工技能培训，会导致团队因缺乏关键监督人员而无法有效利用AI。人力资源解决方案提供商ADP亚太区高级副总裁Jessica Zhang指出，AI输出的不一致与不准确，迫使企业不得不重新引入人工监督，反而导致了重复劳动并降低了生产力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 扩散语言模型，生成吞吐量提升 2.42 倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月1日，英伟达正式开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 扩散语言模型，旨在通过架构创新解决传统自回归（AR）模型逐个 token 串行解码的吞吐量瓶颈。该模型采用“双塔”架构，将任务拆解为保持冻结的“上下文塔”与负责并行生成的“去噪器塔”。在 2×H100 GPU 环境下，该模型在保留基线模型 98.7% 生成质量的同时，实现了 2.42 倍的吞吐量提升。该模型支持扩散模式、模拟 AR 及标准 AR 三种解码方式，遵循 NVIDIA Nemotron 开放模型许可协议，允许商业用途。尽管在代码生成和数学推理任务上存在轻微性能回落，且对 GPU 显存有一定要求，但其为大模型推理加速提供了新的技术路径，特别适用于高频、大规模的文本合成场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic旗下Claude系列大模型正式登陆Microsoft Foundry平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日宣布Claude系列大模型正式入驻Microsoft Foundry（Azure AI Foundry），企业用户即日起可在Azure云环境中部署并调用Claude模型。此次上线型号包括旗舰级Claude Opus 4.8及紧凑型Claude Haiku 4.5，并完整支持Prompt Caching与Extended Thinking等核心技术，适用于复杂编程及智能代理等高阶场景。该服务深度集成微软身份认证、计费及统一治理体系，企业无需调整现有安全架构即可接入。在算力托管方面，用户可灵活选择在Azure环境或Anthropic托管云中运行推理任务。双方表示未来将持续推进平台功能与模型版本的一致性，旨在打破生态壁垒，为企业提供更具灵活性的AI基础设施支持。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
